        ("Coastal brown ants", "Hamersley's brick paving, driveways and retaining walls on free-draining sand host linked super-colonies that run under fences from one cul-de-sac to the next. Slow-acting non-repellent products and baits, APVMA-registered, applied to label. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Ant treatment</a>."),
        ("Rats in the roof", "Reserve bushland, the radio tower reserve and the Warwick Grove precinct keep rodents fed; 1970s tiled roofs with lifted flashings let them in. Baiting in stations plus proofing. <a href=\"/rodent-control-perth\">Rodent management</a>."),
        ("Spiders and cockroaches", "Redbacks in retic boxes and under coping, black house spiders on old brickwork, American cockroaches from ageing sewer and stormwater lines, German cockroaches in renovated kitchens. <a href=\"/cockroach-control-perth\">Cockroach treatment</a> and <a href=\"/general-pest-control-perth\">general pest treatment</a>."),
