        ("Rats in the roof", "Off the 400-metre dune reserve and the boat harbour precinct into ceilings along the western streets. Baiting to label plus a written proofing list for salt-corroded mesh and open roof penetrations. <a href=\"/rodent-control-perth\">Rodent management</a>."),
