        ("Coastal brown ants", "Under driveways, alfresco paving and the limestone retaining walls that step between blocks. Non-repellent product and bait, APVMA-registered and applied to its label, so the whole colony goes rather than one nest. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Ant management</a>."),
        ("Rats and mice", "Golf course edges, the freeway and Burns Beach Road verges, and the station precinct. Baiting to label and a proofing list for garage doors, meter boxes and roof penetrations. <a href=\"/rodent-control-perth\">Rodent management</a>."),
        ("Mosquitoes", "The golf course lakes and irrigated fairways on the south-eastern side breed mosquitoes through spring and summer. Harbourage treatment of shaded vegetation, applied to label, and advice on the water around your own block. <a href=\"/mosquito-control-perth\">Mosquito management</a>."),
