        ("How long does it take you to get to Carine?", "About eight minutes from Warwick along Beach Road or Marmion Avenue. Same-day for active pests is usually possible, and we can generally fit Carine in around jobs in Duncraig and Karrinyup on the same run."),
        ("Are 1970s and 1980s Carine homes at real termite risk?", "Yes. They have timber roof framing and timber door frames, they sit on yellow sand over limestone that holds moisture, and many of the original chemical barriers have been bridged by later paving, extensions or garden beds. An inspection to AS 4349.3 every twelve months is the standard for this age of housing, and a management system to AS 3660.2 where activity or high risk is found. <a href=\"/termite-inspection-perth\">Book an inspection</a>."),
        ("Why do the ants in Carine keep coming back after I spray them?", "Almost certainly coastal brown ants. They form linked super-colonies with many queens across several properties, and a repellent spray only splits the colony into more nests. The treatment that works is a slow-acting non-repellent product or a bait matrix carried back to the queens, applied to label. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Read more</a>."),
        ("Can you do anything about the mosquitoes from the Carine swamps?", "We cannot treat the reserve itself, but we can reduce the numbers that rest on your property. Adult mosquitoes shelter in shaded, still vegetation and along fences through the day, and a harbourage treatment of those areas with an APVMA-registered product applied to label knocks the local population down for weeks. We also walk the yard for breeding water you may not have noticed. <a href=\"/mosquito-control-perth\">Mosquito management</a>."),
        ("What does a general pest treatment in Carine involve?", "An internal and external treatment for spiders, cockroaches and ants, low-odour and non-staining indoors, with a roof-void check where access allows. A typical three-bedroom home, internal and external, sits in the $250 to $350 range. Every job is quoted itemised in writing. <a href=\"/pest-control-prices-perth\">See the investment guide</a>."),
