        ("What do you do about ants in Westminster driveways?", "Identify the species, which is usually coastal brown ant, then treat the whole colony with slow-acting non-repellent product and baits applied to label. Repellent sprays split the colony and it comes back in more places. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Read more</a>."),
