    now="Spring on the Marmion coast: coastal brown ants are the first call as the paving warms, then redbacks under outdoor furniture and along limestone walls. Sea-breeze evenings in November are when termite alates fly, and with most original homes now past fifty years old, an inspection before then catches anything that established last summer.",
