        ("Coastal brown ants", "Warm sand over limestone along the beachfront streets is exactly the habitat they are named for. Super-colonies under paving, retaining walls and pool surrounds are treated at colony level with slow-acting non-repellent products applied to label. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Ant management</a>."),
        ("Rats in the roof", "Star Swamp is the source. Autumn brings rats into the older roof spaces along the reserve boundary and along the coast where salt has corroded the flashings. Baiting to label plus proofing the entry points. <a href=\"/rodent-control-perth\">Rodent management</a>."),
