    now="Spring in North Beach starts with coastal brown ants on the paving as the sand warms, then redbacks under outdoor furniture and along the limestone coping. Star Swamp is full after winter, so mosquitoes are building on the streets nearest the reserve. For the older timber-framed homes around Flora Terrace, a termite inspection now is well ahead of the November alate flights.",
