        ("Why do ants keep coming back at my Innaloo unit?", "Coastal brown ant super-colonies run under the shared paving and along the slabs of the whole complex, so a repellent spray at one unit just pushes them next door. We treat at colony level with slow-acting non-repellent products and baits, APVMA-registered and applied to label. Ask about a combined external treatment across the complex. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Read more</a>."),
