        ("What does a general pest treatment in Innaloo involve?", "Internal and external treatment for spiders, cockroaches and ants with low-odour non-staining products indoors, APVMA-registered and applied to label. A typical three-bedroom home, internal and external, sits in the $250 to $350 range. Every job is quoted itemised in writing. <a href=\"/pest-control-prices-perth\">See the investment guide</a>."),
