        ("Coastal brown ants", "Trigg is core coastal brown ant country: warm sand over limestone, super-colonies under paving, retaining walls and pool surrounds. Colony-level treatment with slow-acting non-repellent products and baits, applied to label. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Ant management</a>."),
