    now="Spring in Pearsall means coastal brown ants surfacing along driveway edges and paving as the sand warms, and the first mosquito evenings drifting over from the Yellagonga wetlands. Roof voids that took rats in over winter need clearing and proofing now. Although the housing is newer, termite alates fly in November and a slab home with raised garden beds deserves an inspection before swarm season.",
