        ("Spiders and cockroaches", "Redbacks under outdoor furniture and retic boxes, black house spiders on old brick, American cockroaches from ageing sewer lines and German cockroaches in the flats and units. Low-odour non-staining products indoors. <a href=\"/cockroach-control-perth\">Cockroach management</a>."),
