        ("Why are coastal brown ants such a problem in Woodlands?", "The free-draining yellow sand under the suburb is their preferred habitat, and the large blocks with long paths, retaining walls and pool paving give them plenty of cover. They live in super-colonies with many queens, so a repellent spray just moves them. Non-repellent products and baits applied to label collapse the colony. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Read more</a>."),
        ("Do you treat mosquitoes near Jackadder Lake?", "Yes. We cannot treat the lake itself, but a harbourage treatment of the foliage, fences and shaded walls where adult mosquitoes rest during the day, applied to label, makes a real difference to an evening outside. Timing it to the spring breeding season matters, and clearing gutters and pot saucers helps. <a href=\"/mosquito-control-perth\">Mosquito management</a>."),
