        ("Termites", "Limestone footings, timber subfloors and original framing in the 1950s homes, plus new apartment slabs whose penetrations are hidden by landscaping. Inspections to AS 4349.3 and drill-and-inject management systems to AS 3660.2. <a href=\"/termite-inspection-perth\">Termite inspection</a>."),
        ("Coastal brown ants", "Warm dune sand under paving, limestone retaining walls and pool surrounds from the beach to Doubleview. Linked super-colonies across several blocks; we treat with slow-acting non-repellent products and baits, never a repellent spray. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Ant management</a>."),
        ("Rats and mice", "The beachfront restaurants, the parks on the old wetland and salt-corroded roof flashings keep rats moving through Scarborough all year. We bait to label and proof the roofline with corrosion-resistant mesh. <a href=\"/rodent-control-perth\">Rodent management</a>."),
        ("Spiders and cockroaches", "Redbacks under limestone coping and outdoor furniture, black house spiders on rendered walls and balconies, and American cockroaches from the stormwater and sewer lines on the low streets around Abbett Park. <a href=\"/general-pest-control-perth\">General pest treatment</a>."),
