        ("Termites", "Original 1950s timber framing and subfloors, and the new triplex slabs built beside them. Inspections to AS 4349.3, management systems installed to AS 3660.2 with the boundary conditions of a subdivided block in mind. <a href=\"/termite-inspection-perth\">Termite inspection</a>."),
        ("Coastal brown ants", "Paved courtyards, shared retaining walls and the narrow gaps between triplex units are where the super-colonies sit. Slow-acting non-repellent treatment across the whole block, not a repellent spray that splits the colony. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Ant management</a>."),
        ("Rats in the roof", "Old timber eaves, the Wanneroo Road commercial strip and the Herdsman wetlands to the south-west keep rats moving into Joondanna roof spaces every autumn. Baiting to label plus proofing of the original roofline. <a href=\"/rodent-control-perth\">Rodent management</a>."),
