        ("Coastal brown ants", "Beldon is core coastal brown ant country: super-colonies under driveways, limestone retaining walls and pool surrounds spanning several properties. Slow-acting non-repellent treatment and baits, never a repellent spray. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Ant management</a>."),
