        ("What is the investment for a general pest treatment in Churchlands?", "A typical three-bedroom home, internal and external, sits in the $250 to $350 range. Every job is quoted itemised in writing. <a href=\"/pest-control-prices-perth\">See the investment guide</a>. Larger two-storey homes and pool surrounds are quoted on their footprint."),
