        ("Rats and mice", "Old tile roofs, fibro sheds, and tree belts along Beaufort Park and RA Cook Reserve. Baited to label in locked stations, then the roofline sealed. <a href=\"/rodent-control-perth\">Rodent management</a>."),
        ("Mosquitoes", "Flat grey sand, shallow groundwater and stormwater sumps mean standing water after every good rain. We treat harbourage on the property and help you find the breeding sites in gutters, pot bases and drains. <a href=\"/mosquito-control-perth\">Mosquito management</a>."),
