    now="Spring in Bedford brings coastal brown ants out along the paving and driveway edges, mosquitoes from the last of the winter rain sitting in sumps and gutters, and rodents that spent winter in the roof starting to move. Most homes here are post-war timber framing on damp sand, so a termite inspection before the November swarm is worth booking now.",
