        ("German cockroaches", "Apartments and terraces near the Hay Street and Rokeby Road food strips. Gel baits and low-odour non-staining products applied to label in kitchens, not a broad spray. <a href=\"/cockroach-control-perth\">Cockroach treatment</a>."),
