    now="Spring in Subiaco means coastal brown ants along the laneway paving, rats moving out of roof voids as the nights warm, and German cockroach numbers building in kitchens near the Rokeby Road strip. With so much irreplaceable Federation timber here, a termite inspection before the November swarm is the job that matters most this season.",
