        ("Are Federation homes in Subiaco a termite risk?", "Yes. Jarrah floors on stumps, timber wall plates and roof framing, decades of garden beds against the walls and no original chemical barrier. Subterranean termites reach them through the sand and the limestone pockets. An annual inspection to AS 4349.3 is the baseline for any pre-war home here. <a href=\"/termite-inspection-perth\">Book an inspection</a>."),
        ("Do you treat apartments and strata in Subiaco?", "Yes. We treat individual apartments and strata common areas, including bin rooms and car parks, and document each area treated so the strata manager has a clear record. A combined treatment across a building is far more effective against German cockroaches than treating one unit at a time. <a href=\"/cockroach-control-perth\">Cockroach treatment</a>."),
