        ("Termites", "1970s timber roof framing, fascias and pergolas on low footings, with sheds and gardens against the walls, on Bassendean sand. Inspections to AS 4349.3 and chemical management systems to AS 3660.2. <a href=\"/termite-inspection-perth\">Termite inspection</a>."),
        ("Coastal brown ants", "Grey sand under old paving, retaining walls and shed slabs, colonies linked across the generous blocks. Non-repellent products and baits applied to label; a repellent spray only moves them. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Ant management</a>."),
        ("Rats and mice", "Reserves on three sides, old sheds, fruit trees and 1970s eave gaps. Baiting to label with a written proofing list for the roofline and outbuildings. <a href=\"/rodent-control-perth\">Rodent management</a>."),
        ("Spiders and cockroaches", "Redbacks in sheds and retic boxes, black house spiders under pergolas, Australian native cockroaches from the leaf litter and mulch. Low-odour treatment inside, full external. <a href=\"/general-pest-control-perth\">General pest treatment</a>."),
